/**
 * Anti-aliased glyph data for the interface faces.
 *
 * <p>Generated by {@code codegen/FontGen.java ui} from DejaVu Sans;
 * do not edit by hand. Two bits of coverage per pixel give four levels
 * of opacity, which is enough to take the jagged edges off text without
 * quadrupling the data.</p>
 *
 * <p>The character set covers ASCII and the whole of Vietnamese, including
 * every tone mark combination, so interface text and game text both render
 * correctly rather than as question marks.</p>
 */
